flowchart TB
    subgraph Reviews["app/modules/reviews"]
        direction LR
        Entry["controllers · listeners · callback boundary"]
        Inbound["actions/ports/inbound<br/>ReviewActionFactory contract"]
        UseCases["actions/commands + queries<br/>session · task/sprint · dispute · AI"]
        Rules["domain<br/>workflow · dispute · readiness"]
        Outbound["actions/ports/outbound<br/>people · work · AI · persistence capabilities"]
        Infra["infra<br/>models · repositories · adapters"]

        Entry --> Inbound -->|"one selected intent"| UseCases
