        UseCases --> Outbound
        Outbound --> Infra
    end

    Families["app/composition/factories/reviews<br/>sprint · task · dispute · AI · event"]
    Providers["tasks · projects · organizations<br/>users · skills · authorization · Audit"]
    PostgreSQL[("PostgreSQL<br/>review/dispute/receipt tables")]
    Clawagent["Clawagent API<br/>signed callback boundary"]

    Families -.->|"construct only"| UseCases
    Outbound -->|"outer adapter"| Providers
    Infra --> PostgreSQL
    Outbound -->|"AI adapter"| Clawagent

